# Per-tool caches and local state. Every sibling repo in this workspace ignores
# the same set; this repo had no .gitignore at all until 2026-09-22, so an
# indexer's cache could have been committed into the one file the marketplace
# is made of.
.serena/
.tokensave/
.memorygraph/

# Execution plans handed to a repo-rooted session. Local by design.
.plan/

# Claude Code's per-machine settings. The shared config is dotfiles-owned.
.claude/settings.local.json
